* ============================================================
* gm/Id Characterization -- PMOS |Vsd| sweep at fixed |Vsg|
* W = {w_um} um   L = {l_um} um   |Vsg| = fixed
* Vd sweep: {vd_start} -> {vd_stop} V  step {vd_step} V
* Python computes |Vsd| = VDD - Vdrain
* ============================================================

.include {model_path}

* VDD rail (PMOS source and bulk)
VDD  vdd   0   DC {vdd_v}

* Gate: fixed at VDD - |Vsg_bias|
Vgate gate  0   DC {vg_v}

* Drain: swept from VDD down to (VDD - vds_stop), may go negative
Vdrain drain 0  DC {vdd_v}

* PMOS DUT:  D=drain  G=gate  S=vdd  B=vdd
M1 drain gate vdd vdd {model} W={w_um}u L={l_um}u

.options reltol=1e-6 vntol=1e-9 abstol=1e-12
.temp 27

.control
  dc Vdrain {vd_start} {vd_stop} {vd_step}
  wrdata {dat_path} v(drain) i(Vdrain)
  quit
.endc

.end
